sequenceDiagram
    actor UserA
    actor UserB
    participant A as Device A (advertiser)
    participant B as Device B (discoverer)

    A->>A: startAdvertising(serviceId)
    B->>B: startDiscovery(serviceId)
    B-->>A: endpoint found -> requestConnection
    A-->>B: onConnectionInitiated(authToken)
    Note over A,B: both verify the SAME token - mutual trust, anti-MITM
    UserA->>A: accept; UserB->>B: accept
    A->>B: connection established
    A->>B: sendPayload(FILE) -> streamed with progress (Ch 61)
    B-->>A: onPayloadTransferUpdate(progress)
    Note over A,B: drop -> retry + resume remainder, Ch 2/61
